<title>UK: Charlton gets nod for new main stand.</title>
<headline>Charlton gets nod for new main stand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly floated British soccer club Charlton Athletic Plc said on Wednesday that it has planning permission for the development of the main (West) stand at its football ground, the Valley.</p>
<p>Work will start on the new 3.5 million stg stand, which  will seat up to 8,000 spectators, following Charlton's last home game on May 4.</p>
<p>The first phase of the development at the first division club is expected to be completed by early in the 1997/98 football season.</p>
<p>Charlton shares made their debut on the Alternative Investment Market (AIM) on March 21.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
